Roc Mind Spark
==============

This project is a macOS overlay app derived from MindSpark, an open-source
mind-mapping editor by Prasad Patil and contributors:

    https://github.com/prasadpatil25/MindSpark

The canvas (`web/public/`), local Node server (`web/server.js`), templates,
and most of the editing UI come from that project. A few worker modules under
`web/worker/` are inherited internal code used by unit tests. They are not a
supported Cloudflare, Pages, or collaboration deploy of Roc Mind Spark.

Roc Mind Spark adds a native macOS shell (Swift / AppKit / WKWebView) so the
map can be summoned over any Space with a global hotkey.

